next-level (beep), huh?

00:12:06.280 --> 00:12:07.200
(crowd cheers)

00:12:07.200 --> 00:12:09.000
Did Steve ever show you
that classified (beep)?

00:12:09.000 --> 00:12:10.717
No he didn't.

00:12:10.717 --> 00:12:12.870
