00:12:26.885 --> 00:12:30.650
(audience member screams)

00:12:30.650 --> 00:12:31.483
Woo!

00:12:32.410 --> 00:12:36.013
Let's see Steve jobs do that. (laughs)

00:12:37.120 --> 00:12:38.773
- Marjorie, I'd love a cupcake.

00:12:40.080 --> 00:12:41.950
Thank you so much for coming today.

00:12:41.950 --> 00:12:44.460
As you know, every year,
the vice president hosts

00:12:44.460 --> 00:12:46.500
