sexist or racist or homophobic.

00:12:54.010 --> 00:12:55.860
So if you hear anything that could be

00:12:55.860 --> 00:12:59.650
in any way offensive to anyone,
just raise your hand and-

00:12:59.650 --> 00:13:01.800
Oh, I hadn't really started yet.

00:13:01.800 --> 00:13:03.410
Uh, did you find something offensive?

00:13:03.410 --> 00:13:05.340
- The fact that you think
I need a man's permission

00:13:05.340 --> 00:13:07.890
to raise my hand is insane.

00:13:07.890 --> 00:13:10.420
I can raise my hand whenever
I want to raise my hand

00:13:10.420 --> 00:13:11.820
because I'm a free woman.

00:13:11.820 --> 00:13:14.010
