raise my hand like this,

00:13:14.010 --> 00:13:15.610
like a big old Black power fist?

00:13:15.610 --> 00:13:17.160
Yeah, huh, boss man?

00:13:17.160 --> 00:13:18.309
Is that what you want from me?

00:13:18.309 --> 00:13:19.310
- Is this what you wanted?

00:13:19.310 --> 00:13:22.790
A floppy, gay hand just
floating around in the air.

00:13:22.790 --> 00:13:24.960
Well here we go, here's
my floppy gay, hand

00:13:24.960 --> 00:13:27.390
at the end of my limp, gay wrist.

00:13:27.390 --> 00:13:28.223
Happy?

00:13:28.223 --> 00:13:29.493
- No, Jesus, no.

00:13:30.330 --> 00:13:31.510
Wow, what?

00:13:31.510 --> 00:13:32.750
- Why not "Mary, no"?

00:13:32.750 --> 00:13:33.710
Or "Rachel, no"?

00:13:33.710 --> 00:13:35.160
Or "Bathsheba, no"?

00:13:35.160 --> 00:13:37.690
Why does it have to be Jesus, a man?

00:13:37.690 --> 00:13:39.970
- And are we talking about the
Jesus that accepts everyone?

00:13:39.970 --> 00:13:41.690
Or the Jesus who doesn't believe

00:13:41.690 --> 00:13:44.100
