00:16:04.629 --> 00:16:06.530
(men laughing)

00:16:06.530 --> 00:16:07.363
- Oh sir, sir sir.

00:16:07.363 --> 00:16:10.010
- Oh my gosh, that is too rich.

00:16:10.010 --> 00:16:11.560
Thanks so much for coming in, Adam.

00:16:11.560 --> 00:16:12.670
