00:16:15.161 --> 00:16:16.241
Done a number on my stomach.

00:16:16.241 --> 00:16:18.950
(play fighting and laughing)

00:16:18.950 --> 00:16:21.241
- Here's your fortune, you're
gonna be sick in a half hour.

00:16:21.241 --> 00:16:23.908
(both laughing)

00:16:25.430 --> 00:16:27.700
- Oh my gosh, what an
absolute delight, Adam.

00:16:27.700 --> 00:16:30.390
- It's been great, and can I
tell you something real quick?

00:16:30.390 --> 00:16:31.920
I don't even care if I get this job.

00:16:31.920 --> 00:16:34.690
Because I know I've
made a friend for life.

00:16:34.690 --> 00:16:36.040
- What a terrific attitude.

00:16:36.900 --> 00:16:39.500
What a great goddamn attitude.

00:16:39.500 --> 00:16:41.330
You son of a gun.

00:16:41.330 --> 00:16:42.163
You know what?

00:16:44.043 --> 00:16:45.580
Right quick before you leave,
I want to give you something.

00:16:45.580 --> 00:16:47.180
- No, sir, I can't take any more gifts.

00:16:47.180 --> 00:16:48.743
This whole thing has been a gift.

00:16:51.180 --> 00:16:52.854
- My brother passed away...

00:16:52.854 --> 00:16:55.290
(sad piano music)

00:16:55.290 --> 00:16:56.313
21 years ago.

00:16:57.340 --> 00:17:00.510
We were estranged and he became ill

00:17:02.380 --> 00:17:05.223
