00:17:10.220 --> 00:17:12.453
on a boat very much
like this one and died.

00:17:14.010 --> 00:17:15.380
I saw him struggling all the way

00:17:15.380 --> 00:17:18.040
as a riptide just pulled him down.

00:17:18.040 --> 00:17:18.873
- Bitch ocean!

00:17:19.850 --> 00:17:22.490
- Would you please accept this
as a token of my gratitude

00:17:22.490 --> 00:17:24.440
for you bringing joy back into my life?

00:17:25.672 --> 00:17:28.022
- Under any other
circumstance, I would refuse.

00:17:29.780 --> 00:17:31.480
But I will accept this gift today.

00:17:32.660 --> 00:17:35.210
Because I know how much it
means to you, so I will.

00:17:37.139 --> 00:17:38.139
- Thank you.

00:17:40.463 --> 00:17:41.546
- Ahoy matey.

00:17:42.901 --> 00:17:45.568
(both laughing)

00:17:51.362 --> 00:17:53.562
- How is that funny?

00:17:53.562 --> 00:17:55.196
- Bernadette.

00:17:55.196 --> 00:17:58.930
Bernadette, are you hearing any of this?

00:17:58.930 --> 00:18:01.462
This guy, how do you keep
a straight face all day?

00:18:01.462 --> 00:18:04.680
