00:18:04.680 --> 00:18:05.880
- Isn't she sweet?

00:18:05.880 --> 00:18:07.960
- Sweeter than pie, sir.
- Oh my God.

00:18:07.960 --> 00:18:10.300
- Goddammit I love your (bleep) energy.

00:18:10.300 --> 00:18:11.520
- Well.

00:18:11.520 --> 00:18:12.980
What can I say, sir?

00:18:12.980 --> 00:18:14.272
I am solar-powered!

00:18:14.272 --> 00:18:18.689
(Mr. Weinstein laughs at high pitch)

00:18:26.670 --> 00:18:27.729
- Really?

00:18:27.729 --> 00:18:29.630
You like you like that one, huh?

00:18:29.630 --> 00:18:32.203
- Oh thanks so much, Adam, terrific.

00:18:34.210 --> 00:18:37.803
Best interview I've ever been
a part of in my entire life!

00:18:38.770 --> 00:18:39.813
Okay, who's next?

00:18:42.840 --> 00:18:43.673
You, ready?

00:18:43.673 --> 00:18:44.917
Let's go, chop chop, here we go.

00:18:44.917 --> 00:18:47.167
(clapping)

00:18:49.150 --> 00:18:50.050
Come on, let's go.

00:18:51.314 --> 00:18:52.795
- (claps) Okay!

00:18:52.795 --> 00:18:54.380
Woo!

00:18:54.380 --> 00:18:55.560
Woo!

00:18:55.560 --> 00:18:58.550
Requesting permission
to come on board, sir.

00:18:58.550 --> 00:18:59.980
Hi, Noah Sanders is the name.

00:18:59.980 --> 00:19:01.470
Ah, sorry to hear about your brother.

00:19:01.470 --> 00:19:03.360
Maybe we can get some
Chinese food after this?

00:19:03.360 --> 00:19:05.510
- All right, all right,
okay, take it easy.

00:19:06.930 --> 00:19:08.526
Jeez, settle down Turbo.

00:19:08.526 --> 00:19:11.629
